# Something Fishy (windurst 52): Tokaka (Port Windurst; default event 207: after a zone-in the first talk plays it, the
# next his script, "default"). Available, TokakaSpokenTo 0: a sardine: nothing. 208 (0, 4360), option 0: begun (any
# option), TokakaSpokenTo 1. Accepted: 209 (0, 4360), TokakaSpokenTo 1. Two sardines (hasItemQty is exact): nothing; a
# Bone Chip (no sardine): nothing; a sardine and a Bone Chip (getItemCount 2): nothing; a sardine and 10 gil (a gil slot
# counts in getItemCount): nothing; one sardine: 210 (70, 4360): completed, fame 10, the sardine taken, 70 gil,
# TokakaSpokenTo 0, needToZone. Completed with needToZone: 211; a sardine (var 0): nothing; var 1 (GM) with needToZone:
# nothing; var 0 after a rezone (no needToZone): nothing. Completed, no needToZone: 209 (TokakaSpokenTo 1); a sardine:
# 210: fame 10 (no completion: completed), the sardine taken, 70 gil, var 0, needToZone.
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-188.3,-2.0,66.3 job=WAR lvl=75
item BastoreSardine1 x6
item BoneChip x2
login
trade Tokaka BastoreSardine1 x1         # available, TokakaSpokenTo 0: nothing
trigger Tokaka                          # default 207
finish
trigger Tokaka                          # available: 208 (0, 4360)
finish option=0                         # begun (any option); TokakaSpokenTo 1
trigger Tokaka                          # default 207
finish
trigger Tokaka                          # accepted, no needToZone: 209 (0, 4360)
finish                                  # TokakaSpokenTo 1
trade Tokaka BastoreSardine1 x2         # two (hasItemQty exact): nothing
trade Tokaka BoneChip x1                # no sardine: nothing
trade Tokaka BastoreSardine1 x1 BoneChip x1  # getItemCount 2: nothing
trade Tokaka BastoreSardine1 x1 gil=10  # the gil slot counts: getItemCount 2: nothing
trade Tokaka BastoreSardine1 x1         # one sardine: 210 (70, 4360)
finish                                  # accepted: completed, fame 10; the sardine taken; 70 gil; var 0; needToZone
trigger Tokaka                          # default 207
finish
trigger Tokaka                          # completed, needToZone: 211
finish
trade Tokaka BastoreSardine1 x1         # var 0, needToZone: nothing
charvar TokakaSpokenTo 1                # GM
trade Tokaka BastoreSardine1 x1         # var 1, needToZone: nothing
charvar TokakaSpokenTo 0                # GM
rezone                                  # needToZone cleared (no other zone visited)
trade Tokaka BastoreSardine1 x1         # var 0, no needToZone: nothing
trigger Tokaka                          # default 207
finish
trigger Tokaka                          # completed, no needToZone: 209 (0, 4360)
finish                                  # TokakaSpokenTo 1
trade Tokaka BastoreSardine1 x1         # 210 (70, 4360)
finish                                  # completed: fame 10 only; the sardine taken; 70 gil; var 0; needToZone
